#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/getting_started/tutorial-6-managing-simulation-outputs.ipynb:9
msgid "Tutorial 6 - Managing simulation outputs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/getting_started/tutorial-6-managing-simulation-outputs.ipynb:20
msgid ""
"In the previous tutorials we have interacted with the outputs of the "
"simulation via the default plotting functionality. However, usually we need "
"to access the output data to manipulate it or transfer to another software, "
"which is the topic of this notebook."
msgstr ""

